          "functions": [
            {
              "function": "minecraft:set_written_book_pages",
              "pages": [
                "Gringotts Curse-Breakers\nField notes\n\nThe old tombs here were built to kill robbers, and they still work. Read this before you go in.",
                "1. The curse is in the floor.\n\nSome of the carved tiles are cursed. They look the same as the plain ones. Step on one and it goes off: the roof falls, the dead get up, or the old curse takes your strength.",
                "2. Revelio shows them.\n\nCast Revelio near the tiles. A cursed tile glows red for a minute. It reaches about eight paces, so cast again in each room.",
                "3. Lift a shown curse.\n\nWhile a tile glows, break it. The curse goes out of it. Break it before it glows and the curse goes off in your face.",
                "4. The walls lie too.\n\nThe way down to the true burial chamber is behind a wall. The same Revelio opens it. Do not linger in the gap.",
                "5. Do not touch the gold.\n\nThe pharaohs' gold carries the Gemino curse, the same as the deepest Gringotts vaults. It copies itself and burns. Drop it, or get into water. Bring water."
              ],
              "mode": "replace_all"
            },
            {
              "function": "minecraft:set_book_cover",
              "title": "Field Notes",
              "author": "A Gringotts Curse-Breaker",
              "generation": 0
            }
          ]
        }
